  "problem": "Payer provider-reference IDs could be treated as NPIs or hospital CCNs. Equal numeric reference IDs in different files could be joined accidentally. Missing referenced objects could invent provider groups from hospital names. An NPI-bearing rate could automatically map to a hospital CCN or a complete facility roster. Source-local reference resolution could perform an implicit cross-source identity merge.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Provider-reference resolution lives in packages/connectors/mrf/payer-provider-reference.mjs because identity is WP7-sealed. Provider-group IDs are scoped to the reporting file/version. Equal numeric IDs in different files cannot be joined. A missing referenced object yields an unresolved association; no provider group is invented from a hospital name. An NPI-bearing rate does not automatically map to a hospital CCN or a complete facility roster. Reference closure has explicit count and byte limits. Source-local resolution never performs an implicit cross-source identity merge. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
